r and Proteinase K treatment at 55°C for 2 hours. DNA was then extracted using Beckman Coulter's Agencourt RNAdvance Cell v2 kit following the manufacture’s instructions. Eluted DNA was then treated for WGBS as described before	32388347	1619417350	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR313/000/SRR3135540/SRR3135540.fastq.gz	e717392188efe73cd92f4185034c6d53	1483835032
